<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in April.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in April.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published the following data relating to M3 money supply in April</p>
<p>AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	   Apr     Mar  Apr95 End Apr</p>
<p>									Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)		+12.6   +37.4  +32.0 4877.0</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	  +-0.0   +-0.0  +-0.0    8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		 +12.6   +37.4  +32.0 4868.3</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals    +15.5   +23.3  +22.8 3680.3</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     short term lending	   - 9.0   + 6.7  - 2.5  599.6</p>
